{title: Mohabbat Hai}
{artist: Stebin Ben Jeet Ganguly}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
Dil [Bm] Ki Baato Ko [A] Dil Sun Lega,        [G] Tum Ye Kaho Na [Bm] Kaho
Ho [Bm] Pyar Chupaana Toh,        [A] In Aankho [G] Ko Khaamosh Ra [Bm] kho
Chupegi [A] Na Ye Chaahat Hai,        Jo Maangi [D] Thi Wo Mannat [A] Hai
Isey [F#m] Dekho Ye Jannat [A] Hai,        Meri [G] Maano Mohabbat [A] Hai
Tumhe [Bm] Mujh se Mohhabbat [A] Hai,        Mohabbat [G] Hai [A]
Dil [Bm] Ki Baaton Ko [A] Dil Sun Lega,        [G] Tum Ye Kaho Na [Bm] Kaho
[Bm] Tera Junoon [D] Meri Waffa,        [A] Ek Pal Kam Na [Bm] Ho
[Bm] Tere Bina [D] Jeena Pade,        [A] Woh Mausam Na [Bm] Ho
[Bm] Waada Hai Yeh [D] Iss Jahaan Me,        [A] Jab-Jab Ayen [Bm] ge
[Bm] Jitni Mile [D] Jindagiya,        [A] Tum ko Chahen [Bm] ge
Chupi Tujh [A] me Hi Raahat [D] Hai,        Nhi Tujh [G] pe Tera Haq [A] Hai
Tu Bs [Bm] Meri Amaanat [A] Hai,        Meri [G] Maano Mohabbat [A] Hai
Tumhe [Bm] Mujh se Mohhabbat [A] Hai,        Mohabbat [G] Hai [A]
Dil [Bm] Ki Baaton Ko [A] Dil Sun Lega,        [G] Tum Ye Kahona [Bm] Kaho
Chupi Tujh [A] me Hi Raahat [D] Hai,        Nahi Tujh [G] pe Tera Haq [A] Hai
Tu Bs [Bm] Meri Amaanat [A] Hai,        Meri [G] Maano Mohabbat [A] Hai
